---
// Mode Data BI — FULL-PAGE recreation of the REAL mode.com design:
// sage #EEF2E3 ground, lime announcement bar, serif (Grenette→Fraunces) headline
// on stacked lime highlight pills with connected corners, Graphik→Hanken Grotesk
// UI, square 4px buttons (dark green + lime text), capabilities accordion with
// lime active state and real product shots, two-audience columns, "intelligence
// layer" stack diagram, logo strip, serif quote, demo card, Beyond-BI chips,
// dark-green CTA + footer with the real lime MODE wordmark.
// Real photo assets from /assets/mode-data-bi/ (downloaded from mode.com CDN).
---

