  <!-- ============ ANNOUNCEMENT (LIME BAR) ============ -->
  <div class="announce">
    <p>ThoughtSpot acquires Mode to define the next generation of collaborative BI&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="#footer">Learn More &rarr;</a></p>
