      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <section class="hero" id="top">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="pills">
          <span class="pill pill-1">Business Intelligence</span>
          <span class="pill pill-2">built around <span class="rotor" id="rotor">data teams</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-side">
          <p>Mode is the central hub for your organization&rsquo;s analysis, uniting data teams and business teams around data to drive business outcomes.</p>
          <div class="row">
            <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#cta">Try for free</a>
            <a class="btn btn-line" href="#cta">Request demo</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="shot">
        <img src="/assets/mode-data-bi/hero.png" alt="Mode platform screenshot" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ CAPABILITIES (ACCORDION) ============ -->
  <section class="caps" id="features">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="big">Capabilities you can <em>count on</em></h2>
      <div class="acc">
        <div class="acc-item open">
          <button class="acc-head" aria-expanded="true"><span class="num">01</span><span class="t">Ad Hoc Analysis</span><span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="acc-body"><div class="acc-inner"><div class="acc-cols">
            <p>Dive right into your data using SQL and rapidly iterate through queries to deliver results.</p>
            <img src="/assets/mode-data-bi/cap1.png" alt="" loading="lazy" />
          </div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-head" aria-expanded="false"><span class="num">02</span><span class="t">Advanced Analytics</span><span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="acc-body"><div class="acc-inner"><div class="acc-cols">
            <p>Analyze and model on the same platform as your charts and dashboards.</p>
            <img src="/assets/mode-data-bi/cap2.png" alt="" loading="lazy" />
          </div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-head" aria-expanded="false"><span class="num">03</span><span class="t">Interactive Dashboards</span><span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="acc-body"><div class="acc-inner"><div class="acc-cols">
            <p>Share the insights you find through drag-and-drop visual analytics tools.</p>
            <img src="/assets/mode-data-bi/cap3.png" alt="" loading="lazy" />
          </div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-head" aria-expanded="false"><span class="num">04</span><span class="t">Self-Service Reporting</span><span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="acc-body"><div class="acc-inner"><div class="acc-cols">
            <p>Build your own modern reporting, backed up by governed datasets and metrics.</p>
            <img src="/assets/mode-data-bi/cap4.png" alt="" loading="lazy" />
          </div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-head" aria-expanded="false"><span class="num">05</span><span class="t">Explorable, Reusable Datasets</span><span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="acc-body"><div class="acc-inner"><div class="acc-cols">
            <p>Curate governed, reusable datasets that everyone can trust, explore and build on.</p>
            <img src="/assets/mode-data-bi/cap5.png" alt="" loading="lazy" />
          </div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-head" aria-expanded="false"><span class="num">06</span><span class="t">Custom Data Apps</span><span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="acc-body"><div class="acc-inner"><div class="acc-cols">
            <p>Build custom internal tools for thousands of data and business team needs.</p>
            <img src="/assets/mode-data-bi/cap6.png" alt="" loading="lazy" />
          </div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ TWO AUDIENCES ============ -->
  <section class="white duo">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">Clear the path from data to insights, together</p>
      <h2 class="big">One platform. <em>Two teams.</em></h2>
      <div class="duo-grid">
        <div class="duo-col">
          <span class="tag">Made for your data team</span>
          <h3>Go deep, fast</h3>
          <p>In Mode, SQL, R, Python and data viz are all connected to help you deliver insights, faster than ever. No rigid data model should stand in the way of the analysis needed to support business decisions, big and small.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="duo-col">
          <span class="tag">And the teams you work with</span>
          <h3>Trusted self-service</h3>
          <p>Deliver tools for easy, trusted self-service, in record time. Because everyone&rsquo;s analytical tools can live in one place, Mode becomes a central hub full of easy-to-understand data, curated by the data team.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ STACK ============ -->
  <section class="stack-sec" id="stack">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker center">The modern data stack</p>
      <h2 class="big center">The intelligence layer for your <em>modern data stack</em></h2>
      <p class="lede center">Mode amplifies the investment you&rsquo;ve made in every layer of the stack, by getting data you&rsquo;ve made meaningful into everyone&rsquo;s hands.</p>
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="srow mode"><span>Mode &mdash; the intelligence layer</span><span class="chip">Analytics &middot; Reporting &middot; Apps</span></div>
        <div class="srow b1">Modern BI</div>
        <div class="srow b2">Transformation</div>
        <div class="srow b3">Warehouse</div>
        <div class="srow b4">Ingestion</div>
        <div class="srow b4 dim">Raw Data</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stack-links">
        <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#cta">Explore the platform</a>
        <a class="btn btn-line" href="#cta">Take a tour</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ LOGOS ============ -->
  <section class="logos-sec" id="logos">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="logos-head">Mode customers lead their industries</p>
      <div class="logos">
        <span>airbnb</span><span>■ Square</span><span>COMCAST</span><span>McKinsey &amp; Company</span>
        <span>indeed</span><span>Blue Apron</span><span>CROWDSTRIKE</span><span>Ford Foundation</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ QUOTE ============ -->
  <section class="quote-sec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <blockquote>&ldquo;Mode is incredibly valuable as a full stack, full-service platform from a data analyst all the way to an end user. Analysts can go deep, end users get the data they need, and our team gets to make everyone a part of the data strategy.&rdquo;</blockquote>
      <div class="q-who">
        <span class="av">AS</span>
        <span class="nm"><b>Adam Smith</b><i>Analytics Manager</i></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ DEMO CARD ============ -->
  <section class="demo-sec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="demo-card">
        <div>
          <p class="kick">Live weekly group demo</p>
          <h3>Get to know Mode</h3>
          <p>Get a firsthand look at how Mode helps data teams deliver high-impact ad hoc analysis and self-service reporting in one platform.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#cta">Save your seat</a>
        </div>
        <div class="demo-visual" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span class="lime"></span><span class="green"></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ BEYOND BI ============ -->
  <section class="white beyond" id="resources">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">Modern Business Intelligence</p>
      <h2 class="big">Beyond BI as <em>you know it</em></h2>
      <p class="lede">Behind every great idea is really great data. Mode is the single platform to unite data teams and business teams around analytical work.</p>
      <div class="chips">
        <a class="chip" href="#features"><i></i> Ad hoc analysis</a>
        <a class="chip" href="#features"><i></i> Advanced analytics</a>
        <a class="chip" href="#features"><i></i> Self serve reporting</a>
        <a class="chip" href="#features"><i></i> Custom data apps</a>
        <a class="chip" href="#features"><i></i> Interactive dashboards</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ FINAL CTA ============ -->
  <section class="cta-sec" id="cta">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Get more from your data</h2>
      <p>Your team can be up and running in 30 minutes or less.</p>
      <div class="row">
        <a class="btn btn-lime" href="#top">Try for free</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghostlight" href="#top">Request demo</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->
  <footer class="foot" id="footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="foot-grid">
        <div class="brand">
